      "id": 1357024,
      "name": "[Lighter] Knockout Punch",
      "desc": "When Lighter's <color=#FFAF2C>Basic Attack: L-Form Thundering Fist</color> hits an enemy, he gains one stack of <color=#FFAF2C>Inspire</color> (max one stack every 0.5s, up to 20 stacks). If he is launched, he loses 50% of his Inspire stacks. Each remaining stack increases Lighter's <color=#31CC00>Daze dealt by 5%</color>. <color=#FFAF2C>Hold the dodge button to activate Provoke</color>. While active, taking damage triggers Perfect Assist, increasing Lighter's <color=#31CC00>CRIT DMG by 15%</color> for 20s.",
